  "mate2-01": ["The Road to Mate", "Black to move. Strike correctly and mate comes in two moves.", "`Nd7+` is check, and the reply is forced: `Kf7`. Then `Rg7#` is mate. The idea is that the first move shuts every exit on the king, so only one blocked path is left in front of him."],
