  "mate3-01": ["Long Vision", "Black to move. You have a forced mate in 3 moves. Calculate it to the end.", "The whole line is calculated: `Nf5+` `Kxe4` `Nc5+` `Kd5` `c6#`. Each check takes away king squares until he has nowhere left. Note that the replies are forced, so the calculation is a straight line with no branches."],
