  "fork-01": ["A Fork in the Crowd 137", "Black to move. There is a fork that wins a piece. Find the right square.", "`Nc2+` and the piece attacks two targets in the same move. The opponent can save only one, and after `Nxd4+` you win the other. The fork is the knight's strongest weapon because it jumps over everything."],
