  "disc-01": ["The Vanishing Trick", "Black to move. Move the piece in the middle to uncover the check, and pick your jump carefully.", "`Nxd4` opens the line of check for a piece behind it, and at the same time the piece that moved makes a threat of its own. The opponent is forced to run with the king (`Kf2`), so you get a free move to carry on your attack."],
